sequenceDiagram
    %% OVIC EON — Context Access and Deletion Flow
    %% Document ID: EON-ARCH-DIAG-CTX-ACCESS-001

    autonumber
    participant ERE as L4: ERE (Reasoning)
    participant CtxMgr as L6: Context Manager
    participant EMS as L4: EMS (Memory Custodian)
    participant DB as Encrypted Storage (SQLCipher)
    participant Shredder as CryptoShredder
    participant User as User / Admin API

    Note over ERE,CtxMgr: SCENARIO 1: LEAST-PRIVILEGE CONTEXT RETRIEVAL
    ERE->>CtxMgr: query_context(session_id, scope="preferences")
    CtxMgr->>CtxMgr: Check engine permissions (ERE: Read OK)
    CtxMgr->>EMS: Request user preference view
    EMS->>DB: Query encrypted SQLite
    DB-->>EMS: Decrypted preference record
    EMS-->>CtxMgr: Return scrubbed preferences
    CtxMgr-->>ERE: Return UserPreferences (formality, language)

    Note over User,Shredder: SCENARIO 2: VERIFIABLE GDPR USER DATA ERASURE
    User->>CtxMgr: purge_user_data(user_id, auth_token)
    CtxMgr->>EMS: Execute cryptographic purge
    EMS->>Shredder: destroy_user_key(user_id)
    Shredder-->>EMS: Key Permanently Destroyed
    EMS->>DB: DELETE FROM records WHERE user_id = :id
    DB-->>EMS: Rows Removed & WAL Checkpoint Executed
    EMS-->>CtxMgr: Return DeletionReceipt(status="ERASED")
    CtxMgr-->>User: Deletion Confirmation (<500ms)
